        },
        "style": "Title"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_f89fb8036b976da629e196f0",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "设备借用的提交期限为22个工作日。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 1
        },
        "style": "Heading 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_97f796d5f44d53d5adc20a39",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "设备借用的审批责任人为设施组。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 2
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_bfdb9e0a9684d67349371e81",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "设备借用必须提供资产借用记录。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 3
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_1213461c23a47897623a09b9",
        "kind": "table",
        "text": "设备借用记录须保留17个月。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 4
        },
        "rows": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_f8db977a4e69da5b6d09e75f",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "设备借用的紧急例外需要部门负责人书面批准。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 5
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_abd05e44ff5e58c59dc9bb76",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "设备借用必须通过资产服务台提交。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 6
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
